Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:07.83,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:18.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:23.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.42,0:00:27.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:34.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:41.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:49.27,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:55.41,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:59.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:04.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:10.40,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.37,0:01:21.83,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:54.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:57.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不能常常回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:01:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女孩子嘛 总是会有很多东西要买
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:01.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 给你 （洋芋片）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.34,0:02:02.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是干地瓜呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:03.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给七宝的是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.07,0:02:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.84,0:02:07.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.18,0:02:14.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 它还会自己转耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.69,0:02:19.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不胜感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.39,0:02:22.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:24.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:29.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本想特别来和她会合的说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.53,0:02:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得有机会回到故乡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.87,0:02:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是修理飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.97,0:02:36.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该还有很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.37,0:02:38.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也许不回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:41.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为有个老爱摸屁股的色鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.91,0:02:44.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不是这样子的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:45.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:51.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该不需要担心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.55,0:02:57.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第59话 美少女姐妹花拜师学艺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:57.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然无法像父亲一样技术那么好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:04:01.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我而言 算是很不错了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:19.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲 还有大家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:21.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于都回到故乡了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:23.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.31,0:04:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直让你们这么孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:38.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.03,0:04:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能胜任驱魔师的工作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:44.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像很适合继承家业的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.90,0:04:49.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止接受的锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.04,0:04:57.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是为了让你继承衣钵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.28,0:05:01.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也希望你能坚强的活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您那时是想要说什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.75,0:05:37.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:39.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你原谅芹菜姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:41.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.27,0:06:01.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.54,0:06:04.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经三天没吃没喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.76,0:06:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好吃呢 芹菜姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:18.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:22.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢 你们要吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一碗！ 再来一碗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是姐姐芹菜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:31.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妹妹铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.77,0:06:33.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开家乡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.07,0:06:35.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只靠着传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找寻驱魔师隐密的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:41.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道我是驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:42.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会袭击我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.82,0:06:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是想试试你的身手而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是了得呢 大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:47.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:51.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请收我们为徒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.33,0:06:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收你们？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.09,0:06:55.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们身手很不错喔 大姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:59.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师父 请您一定要收我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:00.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通融一下嘛 师父
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托您 师父
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:10.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是师父！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.41,0:07:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行就是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有急事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:18.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非您收我们当徒弟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:20.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教导我们驱魔的功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:21.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则我们回不了故乡的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.83,0:07:32.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们似乎有什么隐情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:35.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的村子是靠着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:39.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在山坡上开垦而维持生活
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.94,0:07:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了稍微扩大田地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.28,0:07:44.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而开垦镇守之森的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却从此让妖怪们横行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:49.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还不只一两只而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.88,0:07:54.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经有好几个村民牺牲了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能逃到其他地方的人还好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:08:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是家里有老人与小孩的人却没有办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都过着不安的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:07.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇守之森有布下结界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:08.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:12.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得到有个驱魔师村的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.41,0:08:13.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如你们所见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师村已经不存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:23.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就让我去如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子里没有能支付给珊瑚姐姐的礼物或钱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:29.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:33.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不打算雇用驱魔师的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且村子很远呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:38.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算赶走妖怪一两次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:41.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们还是会再来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:43.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其那样不如训练我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:46.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会为了大家而努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:50.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.65,0:08:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是一朝一夕能学会的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:08:59.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 如果只是赶走小妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许可以教你们一些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:03.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢您…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:07.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是晚个一两天出发
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.43,0:09:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家应该会等我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先给你们驱魔的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:36.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这附近试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:44.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要光看 快点扇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:10:00.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混合妖怪讨厌的药草与矿物的粉末
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.81,0:10:03.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么做就能驱魔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护你们村子的话很够了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.33,0:10:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些烟确实很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.23,0:10:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过真的可以驱魔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐 不 师父！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:27.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有更华丽的招式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.37,0:10:30.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只学个一招半式反而更危险
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天很晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.61,0:10:35.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天再教你们怎么制作这些粉末
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.25,0:10:42.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚还没有回来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 有件事想请教一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.50,0:10:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人会因为被摸臀部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就背叛了彼此的信赖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:10:59.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,互相保持应有的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.11,0:11:01.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是一种信赖不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:03.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样子的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚没回来果然都是你害的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:10.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:16.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然嘴巴说一定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:18.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却一点都冷静不下来呢 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.81,0:11:42.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜姐姐 看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:49.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:51.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜入的技术我可是不输人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就看你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:00.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:03.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 父亲说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:04.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师武器的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这些材料
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.84,0:12:08.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,材料
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪们的牙齿 骨头与皮革
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们才能对付强悍的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说只要有这些
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:17.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也能够…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会变得更强
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:27.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…芹菜姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:29.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:33.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是一般的小女孩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:43.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种身手…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我们的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原本是个忍者村
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:54.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.52,0:12:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从城里接到了一个不熟悉的驱魔任务
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:03.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然以忍术好不容易打倒妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到那些妖怪的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:10.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了报仇而袭击村子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会用忍术的大家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:16.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几乎都成了妖怪的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.26,0:13:35.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜姐姐 已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.70,0:13:42.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.70,0:13:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.54,0:13:47.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点 父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:52.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜 铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:56.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算只剩你们 也要坚强的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:13:59.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.59,0:14:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:04.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸这么说完之后就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:06.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要坚强…要变得更强
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:09.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让村子再度恢复往日的光景
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲一定是想这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.20,0:14:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:30.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:35.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们连尚未去除妖气的武器都带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:37.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散发妖气的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:38.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会招来大批妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:39.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:49.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:51.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那两人有危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我 铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 姐姐老是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:03.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个我来拿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:06.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也难怪爸爸会期待
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由妹妹我来继承衣钵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.66,0:15:13.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要持续修炼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:18.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定也能成为像父亲所说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.37,0:15:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强悍的忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.71,0:15:27.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.42,0:15:39.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:46.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个 快坐上云母的背
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:47.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到村子里去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.06,0:15:49.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会还给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些东西快丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:56.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大群妖怪正朝着散发妖气的武器过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:58.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的！快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:21.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太迟了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:32.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太迟了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只好打倒妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:38.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,争取逃走的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.25,0:16:40.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.55,0:16:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是让父亲见识我们的力量的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.95,0:16:44.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们毕竟是忍者村的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:49.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有能够除掉妖怪的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:55.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜 铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:59.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算只剩你们也要坚强的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:01.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止接受的锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.47,0:17:04.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是为了让你继承衣钵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.61,0:17:07.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也希望你能坚强的活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.91,0:17:13.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等！不是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:17.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们父亲所说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:19.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是为了让你们这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.93,0:17:26.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有父亲不希望女儿们过的幸福的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是希望你们继承衣钵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.90,0:17:33.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是希望你们坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:35.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚强的活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.41,0:17:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过着幸福的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:39.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.98,0:17:43.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 坐上云母
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧的跟在我后面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜 铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:18:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算只剩你们 也要坚强的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:01.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚强的活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.17,0:18:05.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并得到幸福 才是他期盼的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.78,0:18:15.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:18.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做什么！芹菜姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:22.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚姐姐说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:25.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.82,0:18:32.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:40.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走咯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.07,0:18:47.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不要出手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:19.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:56.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.21,0:20:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.65,0:20:05.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:18.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种家伙也费这么大劲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.73,0:20:20.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是一点都不像你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.27,0:20:21.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:23.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后面让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:46.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.53,0:20:49.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来接你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.65,0:21:10.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 芹菜姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个要坚强的活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.50,0:21:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为弥勒这家伙一直在担心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.70,0:21:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了之后果然不出所料
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:31.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 幸好赶上了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:37.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:40.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的这么担心我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:44.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是所谓的预感吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.25,0:21:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 因为你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:49.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在我眼前浮现 挥之不去的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.60,0:21:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.53,0:22:01.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里 哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.77,0:22:04.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作点啊 弥勒一族
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不想变成那种大人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:30.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.93,0:22:41.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.15,0:22:49.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.39,0:22:52.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.32,0:22:57.66,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.96,0:23:04.33,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.57,0:23:12.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.11,0:23:19.51,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:27.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:35.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.15,0:23:49.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.98,0:23:51.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那家伙竟然带着以前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.38,0:23:53.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和桔梗对决过的邪恶巫女来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.72,0:23:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨了 完全都看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.22,0:23:56.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟不上进度了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.42,0:23:57.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙利用四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.96,0:23:58.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要对你施放可怕的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.19,0:24:01.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都叫我和犬夜叉分手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.99,0:24:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我把话说完
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.16,0:24:03.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.73,0:24:06.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人都说你是暴力劈腿吃醋男
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.83,0:24:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.93,0:24:10.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.24,0:24:12.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女 五十年的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.24,0:24:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.47,0:24:14.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思啦？
